msgid "Season 3: Jun 21 – Sep 21"
msgstr "第 3 季：6 月 21 日 – 9 月 21 日"

msgid "On the season end date (the 21st), we run a Grand Slam at 16:00 UTC."
msgstr "在赛季结束日（21 日），我们将在 UTC 时间 16:00 举办一场大满贯比赛。"

msgid "Season Points reset each season. Elo never resets (lifetime)."
msgstr "赛季积分每个赛季都会重置。 Elo 永远不会重置（终生）。"

msgid "Grades"
msgstr "组别"

msgid ""
"open, rookie, challenger, pro, elite, masters, grand_slam — determine "
"prestige, task pools, points, schedules, and limits."
msgstr "开放、新秀、挑战者、职业、精英、大师、大满贯——确定声望、题目池、积分、时间表和限制。"

msgid "Tournament Scheduling & Preemption"
msgstr "比赛安排和抢占"

msgid "Daily/Hourly (UTC)"
msgstr "每日/每小时（UTC）"

msgid ""
"Rookie: every 4 hours — 03:00, 07:00, 11:00, 15:00, 19:00, 23:00 UTC (no "
"16:00 slot)."
msgstr "新手：每 4 小时 — 03:00、07:00、11:00、15:00、19:00、23:00 UTC（无 16:00 时段）。"

msgid "Challenger: daily 16:00 UTC; preempted by higher grades that day/week."
msgstr "挑战者：每日 16:00 UTC；那天/周被更高的成绩抢占。"

msgid "Weekly 16:00 UTC priority"
msgstr "每周 16:00 UTC 优先"

msgid "grand_slam > masters > elite > pro."
msgstr "大满贯 > 大师 > 精英 > 职业。"

msgid ""
"In any week, exactly one of these runs at 16:00. Grand Slam week -> only GS "
"at 16:00. Masters week -> no pro/elite. Otherwise pro (Tue) and elite (Wed) "
"alternate as backbone."
msgstr ""
"在任何一周，其中的一次运行时间为 16:00。大满贯周 -> 仅 GS 时间为 16:00。大师周 -> "
"没有职业/精英。另外，专业人士（周二）和精英人士（周三）交替担任骨干。"

