msgid ""
"Enter user IDs separated by commas or spaces. You are always a moderator "
"and do not need to be listed here."
msgstr "输入以逗号或空格分隔的用户 ID。您始终是版主，不需要列在此处。"

msgid "The tournament starts automatically at this time."
msgstr "比赛此时自动开始。"

msgid "Maximum number of players who can join."
msgstr "可以加入的最大玩家数量。"

msgid "Ladder always uses a static base score per task."
msgstr "天梯始终对每个题目使用静态基本分数。"

msgid "For Ladder, this is the number of matching rounds."
msgstr "对于天梯，这是匹配轮数。"

msgid "Number of rounds to play."
msgstr "进行的轮数。"

msgid "Pause between rounds, in seconds."
msgstr "回合之间的暂停（以秒为单位）。"

msgid "How often the pool is matched, in seconds."
msgstr "池匹配的频率（以秒为单位）。"

msgid "Time limit for each round, in seconds."
msgstr "每轮的时间限制，以秒为单位。"

msgid "Total time for the whole tournament, in seconds."
msgstr "整个比赛的总时间（以秒为单位）。"

msgid "Advanced JSON configuration. Leave as {} if unsure."
msgstr "高级 JSON 配置。如果不确定，请保留为 {}。"

msgid ""
"Players are paired each round against opponents with a similar score. Runs "
"for a fixed number of rounds — good for balanced, bracket-style events."
msgstr "玩家每轮都会与得分相似的对手配对。运行固定轮数——适合平衡的、括号式的赛事。"

msgid ""
"Continuous pool matchmaking. \"Rounds Limit\" is the number of matching "
"rounds; \"Round Timeout\" is the matching interval. Timeout and score are "
"fixed (per-task, static base score)."
msgstr "持续的池配对。 “轮数限制”是匹配轮数； “Round Timeout”是匹配间隔。超时和分数是固定的（每个题目，静态基本分数）。"

msgid "Tasks are picked automatically from the chosen difficulty level."
msgstr "题目是从所选难度级别自动挑选的。"

msgid "Tasks come from a fixed task pack, played in the pack's order."
msgstr "题目来自固定题目集，按照包的顺序进行。"

msgid "Tasks are picked by the given tags and difficulty level."
msgstr "题目是根据给定的标签和难度级别来选择的。"

msgid "Each player gets tasks in a random order."
msgstr "每个玩家都会以随机顺序获得题目。"

msgid "All players get tasks in the same fixed order."
msgstr "所有玩家都以相同的固定顺序获得题目。"

msgid ""
"Score is based on the 75th percentile of solve times — faster solutions "
"score higher."
msgstr "分数基于解决时间的第 75 个百分位数 - 更快的解法得分更高。"

msgid "Each task gives a fixed base score regardless of the player's solve time."
msgstr "无论玩家的解决时间如何，每个题目都会给出固定的基本分数。"

msgid "Only the match result counts — a win or a loss, with no partial score."
msgstr "只有比赛结果才算数——胜利或失败，没有部分得分。"

msgid "Players are ranked individually."
msgstr "玩家单独排名。"

msgid "Players are grouped and ranked by their clan."
msgstr "玩家按其战队进行分组和排名。"

msgid "Anyone can find and join this tournament."
msgstr "任何人都可以找到并参加这个锦标赛。"

msgid "Only players who have the invite link can join."
msgstr "只有拥有邀请链接的玩家才能加入。"

msgid ""
"Each game uses the task's own time limit. Different tasks may have "
"different timeouts."
msgstr "每个游戏都使用题目自己的时间限制。不同的题目可能有不同的超时时间。"

msgid "All games in a round share a fixed timeout. One task per round."
msgstr "一轮中的所有比赛都有一个固定的暂停。每轮一个题目。"

msgid ""
"Each round has a fixed timeout. Players play multiple tasks (rematches) "
"within the round until time runs out."
msgstr "每轮都有固定的暂停时间。玩家在一轮内完成多个题目（重赛），直到时间耗尽。"

msgid ""
"One global timeout for the entire tournament. Games use the remaining "
"tournament time. Tournament ends automatically when time expires."
msgstr "整场比赛有一次全球暂停。比赛使用剩余的锦标赛时间。比赛时间到时自动结束。"

